      "content": "It sounds like you're experiencing some lingering fatigue and heart-related symptoms, which can sometimes happen after a viral illness. However, the racing heart and chest heaviness are signs that you should definitely be seen by a healthcare professional. They can properly assess your condition and determine if this is related to your recovery or something else that needs attention. Please schedule an appointment soon to get a proper diagnosis.",
      "source": "target",
