      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "While some post-viral fatigue is common, relying solely on rest and electrolytes might not be enough if those heart symptoms persist. Blood work is often needed to rule out other issues, especially with chest discomfort. Since you're feeling drained, try taking it easy, but if the racing heart or heaviness continues, a quick check-in with a doctor is the safest bet.",
      "source": "target",
